  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">SleepTite SleepRite is a naturaldrug-free solution for incomplete lid seal — the leading cause of morning dry eye. Our disposable seals are placed over the eyes before sleep to gently maintain full lid closure, allowing the eye's natural overnight repair process to work uninterrupted.</p><p>Used by people managing chronic morning dryness, nocturnal lagophthalmos, and post-procedure recovery, SleepRite delivers real relief without drops, ointments, or chemicals.</p><p>Who we're looking for:</p><p>- Eye care professionals (ODs, MDs, dry eye specialists)</p><p>- Sleep, wellness, and self-care content creators</p><p>- Beauty and aging-well creators with audiences 25+</p><p>- Anyone who's experienced morning dry eye, gritty wake-ups, </p><p>  or post-LASIK dryness and found relief</p><p>What we offer:</p><p>- 14% standard commission </p><p>- 30-day cookie window</p><p>- Unique tracking link </p><p>- Monthly PayPal payouts ($25 minimum)</p><p>- Product samples for review and content creation</p><p>- Brand assets, product photos, and approved talking points</p><p>- Real-time stats dashboard</p><p>Honest content welcome. We don't want scripted endorsements — we want your real experience and your real voice.</p></div></div>",
